<title>USA: FirstMerit to buyback up to 1.5 mln shares.</title>
<headline>FirstMerit to buyback up to 1.5 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>AKRON, Ohio 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>FirstMerit Corp said Thursday that its board approved the repurchase of up to 1,500,000 shares, or about 4.7 percent, of its currently outstanding common stock.</p>
<p>Under its most recent repurchase program announced in the fourth quarter of 1995, the company has bought about 1.3 million shares of the 1.5 million shares authorized, the company said.</p>
<p>FirstMerit is a $5.5 billion holding company.</p>
</text>
